{
  "title": "kissed egyptian beef fillet kebabs",
  "description": "savor the flavors of egypt with our take on a classic dish. featuring tender beef fillet, creamy tahini sauce, and crunchy fresh parsley.",
  "cuisine": "egyptian",
  "diet": [
    "ovo-vegetarian-friendly"
